"command\":\"ls .skilled/skills/sk-doc .skilled/skills/sk-code 2>&1 | head -40\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794560194326,"end":1794560195333}}}}
