{"type":"text","timestamp":1794560321922,"sessionID":"ses_e2be2a3a9ffeGLGI0J0gF3MK6h","part":{"id":"prt_1d4215837002lloU1Uvu7iGRPX","sessionID":"ses_e2be2a3a9ffeGLGI0J0gF3MK6h","messageID":"msg_1d4212c5f001LWy3JoR0DpMlBD","type":"text","text":"T028 is done and its verify passes. Two files changed, and the checkbox in `tasks.md` is left unticked as instructed.\n\n**Files written**\n\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs` line 15-18: the header now says `Four of the twelve rows`, and the enumeration adds that the source template's purity belongs to the manifest generator's check.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown` line 102: the check row now says `Four of them run their owner as a child`, and it names the manifest generator's check of the source template's purity among the outputs carried through.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown` line 103: the embed row now says apply restores and fails when a line appeared outside the block that no shipped section carries, refuses a symlinked `REPO RULES.md` or Cursor mirror it would write, and states that it exits 3 when a write fails after the backup, having restored from it or said why not.\n\nThe claims I added match the code I read: `agents-md-check.cjs:875` runs the generator as the fourth child, `agents-md-embed.cjs:1455` restores on a foreign line as on a dropped one, `agents-md-embed.cjs:826-834` refuses the symlinked router or mirror, and `agents-md-embed.cjs:1425-1433` restores and returns 3 on a failed write.\n\n**Verify output** (run from the repository root with `$CHK` and `$DSR` as the Task Notation defines them)\n\n```\n1\nexit=0\nexit=1\n1\nexit=0\nexit=0\n```\n\nRead in order: `rg -c \"Four of the twelve rows\" $CHK` printed `1`, `rg -c \"Three of them\" $DSR` printed nothing, `rg -c \"exits 3\" $DSR` printed `1`, and `node --check $CHK` exited 0.\n\n`git diff` on the README shows only those two rows changed. The check file's diff also holds the earlier T024 to T027 work that was already in the tree before I started.\n\n**Adjacent defects I did not fix**, because T028 does not name them and scope is frozen:\n\n1. `agents-md-check.cjs:24` still says `the three child tools it runs are read-only modes`, while the engine now spawns four children.\n2. `README.markdown:231` still says the check `runs three owner tools as children in their check-only forms`.\n\nBoth now contradict the four-child statements T028 added. The verify does not catch them. A follow-up edit, or a decision to fold them into T028, is the orchestrator's call.\n\nNothing is blocked on you beyond those two lines and the unticked checkbox. No commit, push or other git write was made.","time":{"start":1794560317495,"end":1794560321922}}}
